&lt;p&gt;输入及输出结果：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="http://blog.coinidea.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/01/QQ%e6%88%aa%e5%9b%be20150111182849-300x104.jpg"
loading="lazy"
alt="QQ截图20150111182849"
&gt;
